id: CTB-SRC0012-1-7
source: SRC-0012
section: §1.7
kind: requirement
extends: LXM-REQ-000088
text: Seeded, configurable monetary policy covers refunds and reversals: full and partial refunds, eligibility, limits, proportional allocation, tax reversals, discount reversals, voucher and wallet effects, idempotency and reconciliation policies.
